### ==================== 注册 ====================

### 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopName": "testShop",
  "username": "shop01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 注册重复账号（测试异常）
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopName": "testShop",
  "username": "shop01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== 登录 ====================

### 登录成功
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "shop01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录失败 - 密码错误
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "shop01",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 登录失败 - 账号不存在
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "notexist",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== Dashboard ====================

### 订单统计摘要
GET http://localhost:8082/dashboard/summary

### 趋势数据
GET http://localhost:8082/dashboard/trend

### 消息通知列表
GET http://localhost:8082/dashboard/messages
### ==================== 商品发布（模板方法模式）====================

### 发布实物商品（应成功）
POST http://localhost:8082/product/publish?shopId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 15",
  "keyword": "苹果 手机",
  "sellingPoint": "最新款苹果手机",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "productType": "physical",
  "mainImage": "/images/iphone15.jpg",
  "brand": "Apple",
  "price": 6999.00,
  "marketPrice": 7999.00,
  "stock": 100,
  "stockWarn": 10,
  "productCode": "APL-IP15-001",
  "sort": 1
}

### 发布实物商品 - 库存为0（应失败）
POST http://localhost:8082/product/publish?shopId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 无货",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "productType": "physical",
  "price": 6999.00,
  "stock": 0
}

### 发布虚拟商品（应成功）
POST http://localhost:8082/product/publish?shopId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "100元话费充值卡",
  "keyword": "话费 充值",
  "categoryId": 5,
  "productType": "virtual",
  "price": 95.00,
  "marketPrice": 100.00,
  "stock": 500,
  "complianceInfo": "有效期至2027-12-31，工信部备案号：XXXXX"
}

### 发布虚拟商品 - 无合规信息（应失败）
POST http://localhost:8082/product/publish?shopId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "无合规虚拟商品",
  "categoryId": 5,
  "productType": "virtual",
  "price": 50.00,
  "stock": 100
}

### 发布电子卡券（走虚拟逻辑，需要合规信息）
POST http://localhost:8082/product/publish?shopId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "星巴克50元代金券",
  "categoryId": 5,
  "productType": "card",
  "price": 45.00,
  "marketPrice": 50.00,
  "stock": 200,
  "complianceInfo": "有效期30天，不记名不挂失"
}

### ==================== 订单管理（状态机）====================

### 订单列表
GET http://localhost:8082/order/list

### 订单详情
GET http://localhost:8082/order/1

### 发货 - 待发货订单（应成功，状态变为待收货）
POST http://localhost:8082/order/ship?orderId=1&operator=admin

### 发货 - 待付款订单（应失败，非法状态流转）
POST http://localhost:8082/order/ship?orderId=2&operator=admin

### 发货 - 已发货订单再次发货（应失败，非法状态流转）
POST http://localhost:8082/order/ship?orderId=5&operator=admin

### 状态流转日志
-- 需要在数据库控制台执行：
-- SELECT * FROM tb_order_status_log;


### ==================== 前台商品（C端）====================

### 商品列表（默认排序）
GET http://localhost:8082/front/products

### 按类目筛选
GET http://localhost:8082/front/products?categoryId=2

### 按关键词搜索
GET http://localhost:8082/front/products?keyword=iPhone

### 按价格升序
GET http://localhost:8082/front/products?sort=price_asc

### 按价格降序
GET http://localhost:8082/front/products?sort=price_desc

### 商品详情
GET http://localhost:8082/front/product/1

### 类目列表
GET http://localhost:8082/front/categories

### ==================== 前台注册登录（复用后台接口）====================

### 前台注册
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopName": "frontShop",
  "username": "customer01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 前台登录
POST http://localhost:8082/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== 购物车 ====================

### 加入购物车
POST http://localhost:8082/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 购物车列表
GET http://localhost:8082/cart/list?userId=1

### 删除购物车商品
DELETE http://localhost:8082/cart/remove?cartId=1&userId=1

### ==================== 下单支付（策略模式 + 状态模式）====================

### 创建订单（支付宝支付）
POST http://localhost:8082/pay/createOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "shopId": 1,
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "13800000000",
  "receiverAddress": "北京市海淀区",
  "payType": "alipay",
  "remark": "请尽快发货",
  "items": [
    {"productId": 1, "quantity": 1},
    {"productId": 2, "quantity": 2}
  ]
}

### 创建订单（微信支付）
POST http://localhost:8082/pay/createOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "shopId": 1,
  "receiverName": "李四",
  "receiverPhone": "13900000000",
  "receiverAddress": "上海市浦东新区",
  "payType": "wechat",
  "items": [
    {"productId": 3, "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### 支付订单（支付宝 - 应成功，待付款→待发货）
POST http://localhost:8082/pay/pay?orderId=6

### 重复支付同一个订单（应失败）
POST http://localhost:8082/pay/pay?orderId=6

### 查看订单状态
GET http://localhost:8082/order/list

### 查看订单商品明细（数据库控制台执行）
-- SELECT * FROM tb_order_item;

### 查看状态流转日志（数据库控制台执行）
-- SELECT * FROM tb_order_status_log;